  "description": "<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Brand Introduction</span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Blingyfur is a premium pet accessory brand specializing in luxurious, design-focused collars and necklaces for cats. Our elegant creations blend feline comfort with high-fashion aesthetics, offering pet parents a way to celebrate their beloved companions with sophisticated style.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Product Description</span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Our collection features exquisite decorative collars crafted from materials including velvet, satin ribbon, freshwater pearls, and crystal rhinestones. Each Blingyfur piece is meticulously designed for indoor wear, prioritizing both beauty and comfort. Perfect for special occasions, photoshoots, or simply adding a touch of elegance to your feline friend's everyday life.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Blingyfur stands apart through our commitment to creating jewelry-quality cat accessories that transform ordinary moments into extraordinary ones. Our designs strike the perfect balance between luxurious aesthetics and feline comfort, with attention to detail that pet fashion enthusiasts immediately recognize. We cater specifically to cat parents who view their pets as family members deserving of the same quality and style they themselves enjoy.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Payment Terms</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Commission rate: 12% on all successful referral sales</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">30-day cookie duration</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Monthly payments via PayPal</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Other Information</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Dedicated affiliate manager providing personalized support</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Access to marketing materials including professional photography</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Early access to new collections and seasonal promotions</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Exclusive affiliate-only discount codes to share with your audience</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Perfect partnership for cat bloggers, pet influencers, and content creators in the lifestyle space</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
